  "id": "follicle-stimulating-hormone",
  "term": "follicle-stimulating hormone",
  "definition": "Follicle-stimulating hormone is a hormone whose blood level can rise in late perimenopause. In this context, higher follicle-stimulating hormone levels are described as a sign of reduced ovarian function and lower estradiol secretion.",
